    env.preview(i, scorer=\"default\")\nflow_tts_controller_implementation_spec.md:838:        return env.answer(rule=\"best_preview_score\")\nflow_tts_controller_implementation_spec.md:854:2. FORWARD(i, target_time, solver, cfg): commit a trajectory toward the clean endpoint.\nflow_tts_controller_implementation_spec.md:856:4. BACKWARD(anchor_id, target_time, noise_policy, num_children, mask): perturb a clean anchor back to a chosen noise level; multiple children implement branching.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"I have enough history to pick a target: the weakest regime is `beta=1.0`, with `beta=0.5` a secondary weak spot. The new policy will keep the strong low-budget and `beta=0.75` behavior mostly intact, but change how mid/high beta spend the last few NFE: less blind full completion, more score-gap driven confirmation and selective local rebranching near the best anchor."}}
