{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_22","type":"agent_message","text":"The controller is rewritten. The main novelty is twofold: beta-conditioned bounded width at mid/high beta, and backward children that are only probed to a late preview first, then promoted to full completion if the preview evidence is still ambiguous or improving."}}
